  "limits": "Non-rational only (see nurbs_curve for weights). Knot vectors must be non-decreasing with the usual multiplicity limits; clamped_knots builds uniform interior knots only. The control polygon in the display mesh is a LINES primitive, which draws one pixel wide in most viewers.",
